$ maestro lesson process l2 --answer "the rule already says it; the lane misread it, so this is a prompt fix, not a doctrine edit"
l2 [processed] the report named a candidate that was never verified
target: lead.md, reporting rule
expected: a done report names the sha the falsifier actually ran against
why: an unverified candidate makes the gate a formality
evidence: w44
project: repo
answer: the rule already says it; the lane misread it, so this is a prompt fix, not a doctrine edit

$ maestro lesson list

